{
  "id": "420",
  "title": "What is Your Biggest Success?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-12-29",
  "synopsis": "The wife asks her husband what he thinks is his biggest success in life.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/613/957d55851b89148c793ad6a903b4f994a283817c.mp3?1514218310",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你最成功的地方是什么？\n\n    一天，老婆问老公：“老公，你觉得你一生中，最成功的地方是什么？”\n    老公想了想，说：“是和你在一起！”\n    老婆很高兴，问：“真的吗？为什么？”\n    老公说：“和你在一起那么长时间，还能活到现在，我觉得自己很成功！”",
    "traditional": "你最成功的地方是什麼？\n\n    一天，老婆問老公：“老公，你覺得你一生中，最成功的地方是什麼？”\n    老公想了想，說：“是和你在一起！”\n    老婆很高興，問：“真的嗎？為什麼？”\n    老公說：“和你在一起那麼長時間，還能活到現在，我覺得自己很成功！”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What is Your Biggest Success?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一天，老婆问老公：“老公，你觉得你一生中，最成功的地方是什么？”",
      "traditional": "一天，老婆問老公：“老公，你覺得你一生中，最成功的地方是什麼？”",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān lǎo po wèn lǎo gōng lǎo gōng nǐ jué de nǐ yì shēng zhōng zuì chéng gōng de dì fang shì shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "One day, the wife asked the husband: “Darling, what do you think is your biggest success in life?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "老公想了想，说：“是和你在一起！”",
      "traditional": "老公想了想，說：“是和你在一起！”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo gōng xiǎng le xiǎng shuō shì hé nǐ zài yì qǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The husband thought for a while, then said: “Being together with you!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "老婆很高兴，问：“真的吗？为什么？”",
      "traditional": "老婆很高興，問：“真的嗎？為什麼？”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo po hěn gāo xìng wèn zhēn de ma wèi shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The wife was very happy and asked: “Really? How come?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "老公说：“和你在一起那么长时间，还能活到现在，我觉得自己很成功！”",
      "traditional": "老公說：“和你在一起那麼長時間，還能活到現在，我覺得自己很成功！”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo gōng shuō hé nǐ zài yì qǐ nà me cháng shí jiān hái néng huó dào xiàn zài wǒ jué de zì jǐ hěn chéng gōng",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
